      en: ["An abandoned settlement from the 18th and 19th centuries.", "Was a small fishing and pearling village.", "Located near the UNESCO site of Al Zubarah.", "The ruins include houses, a mosque, and a fort.", "The fort, Qal'at Freiha, has a distinctive central tower.", "Was abandoned at the same time as Al Zubarah.", "Testimony to life in Qatar before the oil age."]
